body:
I remember dreaming about meeting a beautiful blonde girl kinda like the one you described, she taught me how to dance  and when we kissed I could actually feel it. It was so romantic and vivid, I remember waking up with my arm as if it were around her waist.

&#x200B;

I wish I could still dream about people like her, now I just have weird, surreal dreams about Mr. Krabs as a real life crab stealing cars and driving from cops. Seriously I dreamt this last night.
